#. translators: %d: default cache lifetime in seconds.
#: admin/class-swfl-admin-settings.php:450
#, php-format
msgid "How long API responses are cached (30-86400 seconds, default %d). Use a low value such as 120 for near-live updates during a match."
msgstr "Per quanto tempo le risposte dell’API restano in cache (da 30 a 86400 secondi, predefinito %d). Un valore basso come 120 dà dati quasi in diretta durante una partita."

#: admin/class-swfl-admin-settings.php:477
msgid "Cache warm-up interval (minutes)"
msgstr "Intervallo di preriscaldamento della cache (minuti)"

#: admin/class-swfl-admin-settings.php:486
msgid "A background job (WP-Cron) refreshes the games, rankings and topscorers of your club in this interval, so visitors never wait for the API (0-1440 minutes, default 30, 0 turns the warm-up off). It needs the club number and a site that triggers WP-Cron regularly."
msgstr "Un processo in background (WP-Cron) aggiorna a questo intervallo le partite, le classifiche e i topscorer del tuo club, così i visitatori non aspettano mai l’API (da 0 a 1440 minuti, predefinito 30, 0 disattiva il preriscaldamento). Richiede il numero del club e un sito che avvii WP-Cron regolarmente."

#: admin/class-swfl-admin-settings.php:496
msgid "Warm up after clearing the cache"
msgstr "Preriscaldare dopo aver svuotato la cache"

#: admin/class-swfl-admin-settings.php:502
msgid "Refill the cache in the background right after you clear it manually, instead of waiting for the next scheduled run."
msgstr "Riempire la cache in background subito dopo averla svuotata manualmente, invece di attendere la prossima esecuzione pianificata."

#. translators: %s: list of entries that are neither an IP address nor a CIDR range.
#: admin/class-swfl-admin-settings.php:605
#, php-format
msgid "Ignored invalid trusted proxy entries: %s"
msgstr "Voci non valide dei proxy affidabili ignorate: %s"

#. translators: %d: number of trusted proxy entries that are used.
#: admin/class-swfl-admin-settings.php:614
#, php-format
msgid "Only the first %d trusted proxy entries are used."
msgstr "Vengono usate solo le prime %d voci dei proxy affidabili."

#. translators: %s: club name returned by the Swiss Unihockey API.
#: admin/class-swfl-admin-settings.php:796
#, php-format
msgid "Club name automatically set to: %s"
msgstr "Nome del club impostato automaticamente: %s"

#. translators: %s: club ID that was entered in the settings.
#: admin/class-swfl-admin-settings.php:807
#, php-format
